xt":"때문입니","x":1555,"y":2049,"width":128,"height":38}]},{"text":"다. 최대 원소는 항상 트리의 루트에 존재하므로, 루트 노드를 삭제해야 합니다. 루트를 삭제할 경","words":[{"text":"다.","x":216,"y":2119,"width":40,"height":39},{"text":"최대","x":273,"y":2120,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"원소는","x":352,"y":2120,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"항상","x":464,"y":2121,"width":70,"height":38},{"text":"트리의","x":544,"y":2123,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"루트에","x":658,"y":2123,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"존재하므로,","x":771,"y":2123,"width":178,"height":37},{"text":"루트","x":964,"y":2125,"width":68,"height":35},{"text":"노드를","x":1043,"y":2124,"width":103,"height":34},{"text":"삭제해야","x":1157,"y":2122,"width":136,"height":37},{"text":"합니다.","x":1304,"y":2122,"width":108,"height":37},{"text":"루트를","x":1428,"y":2123,"width":103,"height":36},{"text":"삭제할","x":1541,"y":2121,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"경","x":1656,"y":2121,"width":28,"height":36}]},{"text":"우, 어느 노드를 이용하여 루트를 대체할 것인지를 결정해야 합니다. 이를 위해 먼저 루트 노드와","words":[{"text":"우,","x":213,"y":2193,"width":42,"height":37},{"text":"어느","x":274,"y":2192,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"노드를","x":352,"y":2195,"width":103,"height":35},{"text":"이용하여","x":468,"y":2193,"width":131,"height":39},{"text":"루트를","x":614,"y":2196,"width":104,"height":35},{"text":"대체할","x":731,"y":2194,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"것인지를","x":845,"y":2194,"width":135,"height":37},{"text":"결정해야","x":992,"y":2194,"width":136,"height":37},{"text":"합니다.","x":1139,"y":2194,"width":108,"height":37},{"text":"이를","x":1267,"y":2194,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"위해","x":1346,"y":2194,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"먼저","x":1428,"y":2194,"width":61,"height":37},{"text":"루트","x":1505,"y":2195,"width":69,"height":35},{"text":"노드와","x":1585,"y":2192,"width":104,"height":37}]},{"text":"트리의 맨 마지막 노드를 서로 교환한 후, 마지막 노드를 삭제합니다. 이렇게 하면 최대 원소를 삭","words":[{"text":"트리의","x":212,"y":2264,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"맨","x":326,"y":2265,"width":33,"height":35},{"text":"마지막","x":372,"y":2264,"width":102,"h